1
00:00:03,363 --> 00:00:05,669
-早啊宝贝 早饭就快好了 -早
- Hi honey, breakfast will be ready in a minute. - Hi.

2
00:00:08,124 --> 00:00:10,350
我的手-手-手
My ha-a-a-nd!

3
00:00:12,440 --> 00:00:13,980
好好笑哦 老妈
Very funny, mom.

4
00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:15,380
我知道今天是万圣节啦
I know it's Halloween.

5
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:16,960
假手挺逼真啊
Nice fake hand.

6
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:24,480
我们超爱万圣节
We love Halloween.

7
00:00:24,482 --> 00:00:25,445
尤其是克莱尔
Especially Claire.

8
00:00:25,445 --> 00:00:27,860
我最爱的节日 没有之一
It's my favorite holiday.

9
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:30,140
从小我就喜欢惊悚恐怖的东东
Ever since I was a kid, I loved scary things.

10
00:00:30,580 --> 00:00:32,260
每次新上一部恐怖片
If there was a new horror movie in town,

11
00:00:32,260 --> 00:00:34,080
我肯定第一个去排队
I was the first in line.

12
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:35,200
"一张票 谢谢"
"One, please."

13
00:00:36,089 --> 00:00:37,653
后来我遇到了菲尔
Then I met Phil.

14
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:38,860
"两张票 谢谢"
"Two, please."

15
00:00:50,260 --> 00:00:50,780
好了
Okay.

16
00:00:53,650 --> 00:00:55,204
搞定 帮我拉一下
All right. Do me.

17
00:00:55,204 --> 00:00:56,667
拉呀 拉呀 拉呀
Do me, do me, do me.

18
00:00:56,667 --> 00:00:58,852
小卡 我得说 我穿这个还挺性感
Cam, I have to say, I feel kind of sexy.

19
00:00:59,080 --> 00:01:01,280
性感得吱吱直响 但...
Well, squeaky sexy, but...

20
00:01:01,280 --> 00:01:02,540
你知道 如果不是这么讨厌万圣节
You know I'd be enjoying this more

21
00:01:02,540 --> 00:01:04,660
我觉得老公穿成这样儿也挺好的
if Halloween wasn't such a tough day for me.

22
00:01:04,820 --> 00:01:07,400
但我想你打扮停当去上班
But I want you to go to work...

23
00:01:08,254 --> 00:01:09,467
让他们羡慕嫉妒恨
and knock their socks off.

24
00:01:09,700 --> 00:01:12,520
之前我一直在一间古板保守的律所工作
Well, my last job was at a pretty conservative law firm.

25
00:01:12,640 --> 00:01:14,280
没有人会在万圣节装扮自己
No one there would ever dress up for Halloween.

26
00:01:14,480 --> 00:01:16,960
但很明显现在这间律所...
But apparently at this new company...

27
00:01:16,960 --> 00:01:20,380
呃 我在想是扮成吸血鬼呢 还是狼人呢
Um, right now I'm thinking either vampire or werewolf.

28
00:01:20,462 --> 00:01:22,136
每年都让我很伤脑筋啊
Every year it's harder to decide.

29
00:01:22,136 --> 00:01:23,299
等一下 等一下 不好意思
Wait, wait, wait. I-I'm sorry.

30
00:01:23,309 --> 00:01:25,815
等等 请问你们真的穿着戏服来上班吗
Wait. So people really come to work in costumes here?

31
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:27,960
开玩笑吗 这可是传统啊伙计
Are you kidding? It's epic, bro!

32
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:28,800
传统
Epic.

33
00:01:30,260 --> 00:01:31,540
我是新来的
I'm already the new guy.

34
00:01:31,668 --> 00:01:34,375
我可不想和大伙儿格格不入
I don't want to be the nonpartipation guy, too.

35
00:01:34,540 --> 00:01:35,680
有我在就不会
Not on my watch.

36
00:01:36,780 --> 00:01:38,740
不幸的是 我对万圣节的爱在很久之前
Unfortunately, Halloween was marred for me personally

37
00:01:38,740 --> 00:01:40,120
就因为某件事戛然而止了
by an incident long ago.

38
00:01:40,420 --> 00:01:42,240
现在能撑过这一天我都觉得命大
Now it's just a day I have to get through.

39
00:01:42,540 --> 00:01:43,260
你又来了
So you've said.

40
00:01:43,820 --> 00:01:45,640
好了 大家下午五点半在这儿集合
All right, so, everybody has to be here at 5:30

41
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:46,940
为晚上的鬼屋活动做准备
to rehearse our house of horrors.

42
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:48,280
你们都准备好要打扮成什么了吗
You guys have your costumes ready?

43
00:01:48,307 --> 00:01:50,151
好了 不过暂时保密
Yeah, but it's a secret.

44
00:01:50,380 --> 00:01:52,120
我和曼尼一起弄的
Me and Manny came up with something together.

45
00:01:52,220 --> 00:01:53,380
太棒了
I love that!

46
00:01:53,670 --> 00:01:55,033
-我现在能吃点糖吗 -不行
- Can I have some candy? - No.

47
00:01:55,033 --> 00:01:56,346
你呢 艾丽克斯
How 'bout you, Alex?

48
00:01:56,346 --> 00:01:57,468
我没空考虑这个
Well, I haven't really thought about it.

49
00:01:57,560 --> 00:01:59,600
我明天有三门很重要的考试
I've got, like, three huge exams tomorrow.

50
00:01:59,720 --> 00:02:02,000
宝贝 万圣节装扮可不能临时抱佛脚啊
Honey, you can't just slap something together at the last minute.

51
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,900
你知道吗 如果你能把花功课上的时间
You know, if you gave this costume half as much time

52
00:02:03,900 --> 00:02:05,080
分一半给准备今晚的着装
and attention as you give your homework,

53
00:02:05,460 --> 00:02:06,600
也不至于像现在这样儿
you wouldn't be in this situation.

54
00:02:06,940 --> 00:02:09,020
提醒你一下 你有个孩子是读书天才哦
Can I remind you, you have one child who's not mediocre?

55
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:11,600
这身怎么样 恐怖猫女装
Check it. I'm a scary black cat.

56
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:13,840
吓不倒别人 倒是把我吓得心肝乱颤
The only person that costume scares is me.

57
00:02:14,240 --> 00:02:15,540
-去换一身 -换成什么
- Go change it. - To what?

58
00:02:15,700 --> 00:02:17,880
随便什么 你以前穿过的吧
I don't know. One of your old costumes.

59
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:19,620
宝贝 相信我
Honey, trust me.

60
00:02:19,680 --> 00:02:21,380
如果不换的话 你一整天
I am sparing you an entire day

61
00:02:21,380 --> 00:02:23,500
都会被男人问 你的舌头是否也如猫般有摩擦快感
of guys asking you if you have a rough tongue.

62
00:02:24,980 --> 00:02:25,380
喂
Hello.

63
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:27,700
喂 爸 是我
Hi. Dad. It's me.

64
00:02:27,840 --> 00:02:29,600
我就是问问你和歌洛莉亚准备好今晚活动了没
I wanted to make sure you and Gloria were ready for tonight.

65
00:02:29,720 --> 00:02:31,440
-今晚什么活动 -你不会全忘光了吧
- What's tonight? - What do you mean, what is tonight?

66
00:02:31,660 --> 00:02:33,180
爸 今晚万圣节啊 你知道的
Dad, it's Halloween. You know this.

67
00:02:33,320 --> 00:02:35,600
别着急 莫蒂莎 我逗你呢
Calm down, Morticia, I'm just teasing you.

68
00:02:35,780 --> 00:02:36,520
晚上见
We'll be there.

69
00:02:36,700 --> 00:02:38,200
好 但是要穿戏服来
Yeah, but in costume this time.

70
00:02:38,200 --> 00:02:40,360
这次你不能再像去年那样反戴着棒球帽
You can't just show up with a backwards baseball cap

71
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:42,340
还自称是斯路普·道格[黑人嘻哈歌星]
and call yourself Snoop Dogg like you did last year.

72
00:02:42,440 --> 00:02:43,860
我压根儿就不知道那人是谁
I didn't even know who that guy was.

73
00:02:43,986 --> 00:02:46,151
是海莉把我帽子反过来还叫我这么说的
Haley turned my hat around and told me to say it.

74
00:02:46,220 --> 00:02:47,640
我以为他是什么寻狗侦探呢
I thought he was a dog detective.

75
00:02:48,060 --> 00:02:51,020
听着 别担心 我们已经准备好了
Listen, don't worry. We got the whole thing worked out.

76
00:02:51,580 --> 00:02:51,960
拜拜
Bye-bye.

77
00:02:55,503 --> 00:02:57,177
-哈啰 杰 -你在哪儿
- Hola, Jay! - Where are you?

78
00:02:57,177 --> 00:02:58,300
我捎了曼尼和他同学一程
I have Manny in the carpool,

79
00:02:58,300 --> 00:02:59,573
偶们就快到"辍学区"了
and we're going to the dropout.

80
00:02:59,573 --> 00:03:01,417
辍学? 你是说那个叫埃迪的小孩吗
Dropout? You mean that Eddie kid?

81
00:03:01,417 --> 00:03:01,998
他确实傻逼兮兮的
Yeah, he's a moron.

82
00:03:02,180 --> 00:03:03,200
不是啦
No, the dropout,

83
00:03:03,300 --> 00:03:05,120
就是学校里让孩子们下车的地儿
where you drop the kids in the school.

84
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:06,980
她意思是"下客区"
She means "Drop-off."

85
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:08,300
偶就是这么说滴呀
That's what I said.

86
00:03:08,620 --> 00:03:10,960
听着 你准备好今晚
Listen, did you ever do anything about costumes

87
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:12,160
克莱尔那活动要穿的了吗
for Claire's thing tonight?

88
00:03:12,260 --> 00:03:13,860
偶下午就去取
I'm going to pick them up this afternoon.

89
00:03:14,086 --> 00:03:15,239
你扮成"夜龙"
You're going to be a "Gargle,"

90
00:03:15,239 --> 00:03:17,624
偶扮成邪恶村庄布鲁哈
and I'm gonna be an evil village bruja.

91
00:03:17,624 --> 00:03:19,338
你越说我越糊涂
I know less now than I did before I asked.

92
00:03:19,338 --> 00:03:22,676
布鲁哈就是巫婆 夜龙就是夜龙嘛
Hmm. A bruja is a witch, and a gargle is a gargle.

93
00:03:22,920 --> 00:03:24,080
她是在说夜行神龙
She means "Gargoyle."

94
00:03:24,120 --> 00:03:25,380
我就是这么说的
That's what I said.

95
00:03:25,380 --> 00:03:26,960
你有所准备就好
As long as you got it covered.

96
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:28,560
要是达不到克莱尔想要的效果
Because if Claire doesn't get her Halloween,

97
00:03:28,680 --> 00:03:31,160
她就会变成现实版的巫婆
she turns into a real "Rhymes with 'bruja.'"

98
00:03:31,980 --> 00:03:35,200
哦 不 就我一个穿了
Oh, no. No, no, no. I'm the only one.

99
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:38,980
吃午饭的时候 我会让你戴我的獠牙的
At lunch, I'll let you wear my fangs.

100
00:03:41,420 --> 00:03:43,120
看看这些傻子
Look at those tools.

101
00:03:43,660 --> 00:03:45,900
每年都这样 真是一对蠢蛋
Every year. What a couple of douches.

102
00:03:46,401 --> 00:03:48,526
噢 不
Ohh. Oh, no.

103
00:03:48,660 --> 00:03:49,180
喂
Hello?

104
00:03:49,560 --> 00:03:51,860
只有三个人穿着戏服
There are exactly three people in costume here -

105
00:03:51,860 --> 00:03:53,560
一个傻瓜 一个蠢蛋 还有一个我
A tool, a douche, and me.

106
00:03:53,899 --> 00:03:55,983
可我现在没有时间回家来换衣服了
And I don't have time to go home and change and -

107
00:03:56,340 --> 00:03:57,080
冷静
Calm down.

108
00:03:57,380 --> 00:03:59,100
你带了昨天要送去干洗的衣服了吗
Did you bring in the dry-cleaning from last night?

109
00:03:59,151 --> 00:04:01,176
你是不是想用这个来惹我生气
Are you really getting on me about the dry-cleaning wh-

110
00:04:01,200 --> 00:04:02,580
噢 对了 后备箱里有套西装
Oh. I have suits in the trunk.

111
00:04:02,879 --> 00:04:05,756
看吧 懒人有懒福
Look at that. Yesterday's lazy cures today'crazy.

112
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:08,140
好样的 感谢上帝
Yes. Thank you! Thank you.

113
00:04:09,485 --> 00:04:10,497
这就去换
Okay.

114
00:04:13,040 --> 00:04:14,000
噢终于找到你了
Oh, there you are.

115
00:04:14,216 --> 00:04:15,419
我需要你去开兰普金的会
Hey, I need you in the Lampkin meeting.

116
00:04:15,419 --> 00:04:16,651
-等不能等我先... -只要5分钟
-If I could just maybe have -Five minutes.

117
00:04:16,651 --> 00:04:17,654
好吧
O-kay.

118
00:04:17,654 --> 00:04:19,949
-问你个法律问题 -什么
-Okay, hey. First legal question. -Yeah?

119
00:04:19,949 --> 00:04:22,435
我能平白无故地炒了这俩笨蛋吗
Can I fire those idiots for no reason?

120
00:04:22,435 --> 00:04:23,467
上帝啊
Oh, my gosh.

121
00:04:23,467 --> 00:04:27,968
-你手臂可真壮实 -额 是的
-Those are some major guns you got there. -Eh, yeah.

122
00:04:33,020 --> 00:04:34,170
这东西怎么...
Why won't this...

123
00:04:36,320 --> 00:04:37,020
嗨 杰瑞
Hey, Jerry.

124
00:04:37,420 --> 00:04:39,540
嗨 菲尔 装扮得不错
Hey, Phil. Looking good.

125
00:04:40,136 --> 00:04:43,143
谢谢 看到我们今晚的准备你会更吃惊
Thanks. Wait till you see what we got planned for tonight.

126
00:04:43,143 --> 00:04:45,669
克莱尔和我准备扮成僵尸夫妇
Claire and I are going as corpse bride and groom.

127
00:04:45,669 --> 00:04:48,455
好像夫妇都是行尸走肉吧
As if there's any other kind, am I right?

128
00:04:48,455 --> 00:04:50,570
-我是说 婚姻让人好想死哦 -朱蒂把我甩了
-I'm saying marriage kills you. -Judy left me.

129
00:04:51,200 --> 00:04:52,360
天呐
Oh, my god.

130
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:53,560
真为你遗憾
I am so sorry.

131
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:54,960
当你的同龄人奔赴黄泉的时候
When someone your age dies,

132
00:04:55,020 --> 00:04:56,360
你最想知道什么
What's the first thing you want to know?

133
00:04:56,940 --> 00:04:58,420
是怎么死的 对吧
"Died of what?" Right?

134
00:04:58,820 --> 00:04:59,840
你希望死因是
You want to hear it was something

135
00:04:59,840 --> 00:05:00,980
一件永远不会发生在你身上的事
That could never happen to you.

136
00:05:01,020 --> 00:05:02,180
离婚也一样
Well, it's the same with divorce.

137
00:05:02,560 --> 00:05:05,880
如果是因为 酗酒 出轨 虐待
Tell me it was booze, cheating, physical abuse.

138
00:05:06,460 --> 00:05:08,640
没关系 我是个酒量一般 用情专一的好男人
No problem. I'm a monogamous social drinker,

139
00:05:08,640 --> 00:05:10,080
克莱尔也只有睡着了偶尔踹我一脚
And Claire only sleep-hits me.

140
00:05:10,480 --> 00:05:12,460
别告诉我就那么突然发生了
Just don't tell me it came from out of the blue.

141
00:05:13,300 --> 00:05:14,440
我完全傻了眼
I was totally blindsided.

142
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:17,440
我想这一路走来
I guess somewhere along the way

143
00:05:17,440 --> 00:05:19,260
她发现我不再讨人喜欢了
She stopped finding me delightful.

144
00:05:19,798 --> 00:05:21,672
那完全就是胡扯
Well, that's - that's coconuts.

145
00:05:21,672 --> 00:05:23,046
你超级讨人喜欢
You're super delightful.

146
00:05:23,046 --> 00:05:24,519
但对朱蒂来说不再是了
Not to Judy.

147
00:05:24,950 --> 00:05:27,145
她以前都会因为我的一举一动而大笑
She used to laugh at everything I had to say,

148
00:05:27,145 --> 00:05:29,831
但现在我都记不清她的笑声是什么样的了
But now I can't even remember what her laugh sounds like.

149
00:05:29,831 --> 00:05:31,435
克莱尔会模仿 简直惟妙...
Claire can do it. It's uncan-

150
00:05:33,100 --> 00:05:34,620
我差不多该回家了
I should go back inside.

151
00:05:34,860 --> 00:05:36,120
我还有碗要洗
I have a dish to wash.

152
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:37,920
好吧 但是
Okay, but, hey...

153
00:05:37,920 --> 00:05:40,460
杰瑞 你有什么需要就来找我
Jerry, if you need anything, all right?

154
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:41,920
我是你坚强的后盾
I'm your rock.

155
00:05:47,372 --> 00:05:49,697
你一定会觉得难以置信
You are not gonna believe this.

156
00:05:49,697 --> 00:05:51,231
朱蒂和杰瑞离婚了
Judy just left Jerry.

157
00:05:51,241 --> 00:05:53,777
想想也会 她这些日子都过的不开心
Oh, yeah. She was so unhappy.

158
00:05:53,777 --> 00:05:55,000
他怎么样了
How's he doing?

159
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:57,275
他可不像你这么轻松地就接受了
He's not taking it as well as you are.

160
00:05:57,576 --> 00:05:59,701
抱歉 亲爱的 不是我麻木不仁
Oh, I'm sorry, honey. I don't mean to be insensitive.

161
00:05:59,701 --> 00:06:01,304
只是我现在太忙了
I've just got a lot to get done.

162
00:06:01,304 --> 00:06:04,412
我没有觉得你麻木不仁 我觉得你很讨喜
I don't find you insensitive. I find you delightful.

163
00:06:04,412 --> 00:06:05,765
你觉得我讨喜吗
Do you find me delightful?

164
00:06:05,765 --> 00:06:06,907
噢 天呐 我差点忘了
Oh, god, I just remembered!

165
00:06:06,907 --> 00:06:09,363
杰瑞本应扮演我们走廊处的稻草人的
Jerry's supposed to be our porch scarecrow.

166
00:06:09,363 --> 00:06:10,806
你能请他继续来吗
Can you ask him if he'll still do it?

167
00:06:10,806 --> 00:06:13,092
他现在心情很糟糕
He's kind of a mess right now.

168
00:06:13,092 --> 00:06:16,239
我知道 可有人陪着总归比较好
Yeah, but it might make him feel better be around people.

169
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:17,220
我去试试
I'll try...

170
00:06:17,240 --> 00:06:19,280
不过他的世界刚刚天翻地覆
But his whole world just turned upside down.

171
00:06:20,060 --> 00:06:20,880
你能想象有多糟糕吗
Can you imagine?

172
00:06:21,700 --> 00:06:23,140
前一分钟还夫妻恩爱
