你看起来非常像死人
You look very dead-like.

346
00:13:47,400 --> 00:13:48,880
歌洛莉亚 别说了 我说过对不起了
Gloria, stop it. I said I was sorry.

347
00:13:48,880 --> 00:13:50,440
不不 杰
Oh, no, no, Jay.

348
00:13:50,680 --> 00:13:54,160
从现在起 我只说标准美式英语
For now on, I only speak in proper american,

349
00:13:54,300 --> 00:13:56,480
这样我就不会使你丢人了
so I don't embarrass you.

350
00:13:57,600 --> 00:13:59,160
她刚看完牙回来吗
Did she just get back from the dentist?

351
00:13:59,400 --> 00:14:01,320
她在跟我发脾气 因为我跟她说
She's mad at me because I told her

352
00:14:01,320 --> 00:14:03,020
有时候别人听不懂她在说什么
sometimes people can't understand her.

353
00:14:03,300 --> 00:14:04,280
赶紧去弥补一下吧 杰
Make it right, Jay.

354
00:14:04,800 --> 00:14:06,120
咱俩现在都岌岌可危了
We're all just hanging by a thread.

355
00:14:06,320 --> 00:14:09,107
老爸 你看起来棒极了
Hey! Dad! Oh, you look great!

356
00:14:09,107 --> 00:14:10,300
不错 好了 歌洛莉亚已经就位了
Oh, good. Okay, Gloria's in position.

357
00:14:10,300 --> 00:14:11,833
你好 歌洛莉亚 就是这样
Hi, Gloria. There you go.

358
00:14:11,833 --> 00:14:12,605
你就呆这儿
Right back here.

359
00:14:12,605 --> 00:14:15,021
克莱尔 我不知道自己能否胜任这活
Claire, I don't know that I'm - I'm feeling up to this.

360
00:14:15,031 --> 00:14:16,364
为什么 小卡 为什么呢
Why, Cam? Why?

361
00:14:16,364 --> 00:14:18,098
到底发生了什么事
What happened that is so awful

362
00:14:18,108 --> 00:14:20,112
糟糕到你都不敢告诉我们
you simultaneously can't speak of it

363
00:14:20,112 --> 00:14:22,117
同时却又不住地提起呢
and yet can't stop talking about it?

364
00:14:22,117 --> 00:14:23,490
说不出口 太伤感了
I can't. It's too emotional.

365
00:14:23,490 --> 00:14:24,523
好吧 那下次吧
Okay. Some other time.

366
00:14:24,523 --> 00:14:25,756
-我那时十岁 -天啊
- I was 10. - Oh, god.

367
00:14:25,766 --> 00:14:27,119
跟我的好朋友迪米·瑞格纳一起
Dressed as Quasimodo on a front porch

368
00:14:27,119 --> 00:14:30,617
他扮捉鬼人 我扮敲钟人[巴黎圣母院]
with my best friend, Timmy Reglar, a ghostbuster.

369
00:14:31,040 --> 00:14:32,600
门廊上有一篮糖果 里面还有一张纸条
There was a bucket of candy with a sign.

370
00:14:32,680 --> 00:14:33,900
-上面写着"拿一颗" -一颗
- It said "Take one." - One.

371
00:14:34,600 --> 00:14:36,700
迪米把整篮糖都拿走放到了包里
Timmy took the entire bucket and put it in his bag.

372
00:14:36,820 --> 00:14:38,140
迪米不守规矩
Timmy didn't play by the rules.

373
00:14:38,200 --> 00:14:40,200
这正是我对他又爱又怕的地方
It's what I liked and feared about him.

374
00:14:40,470 --> 00:14:42,935
然后包破了 正好一群小孩走过来
Then the bag broke as a crowd of kids

375
00:14:42,935 --> 00:14:45,261
看到了地上掉的一堆糖
rounded the corner, saw the pile of candy.

376
00:14:45,261 --> 00:14:46,995
迪米说 是小卡拿的
Timmy said, "Cam did it!"

377
00:14:46,995 --> 00:14:49,471
-不给糖就捣蛋 -太好了
- Trick or treat? - Oh, good.

378
00:14:49,471 --> 00:14:50,413
讲出来舒服多了吧
Aren't you glad yo got that out?

379
00:14:50,840 --> 00:14:52,420
好了 大伙 这是我们第一批受害者
Okay, everybody, our first victims!

380
00:14:52,480 --> 00:14:55,020
这可不是彩排咯 准备好了吗
This is not a rehearsal. You ready? You ready?

381
00:14:55,020 --> 00:14:55,780
-好了 好了 -那就好
- Yes. Yes. - Okay.

382
00:14:57,060 --> 00:14:59,640
有种的话就进来吧
Come in...if you dare.

383
00:15:02,280 --> 00:15:02,760
爸
Dad.

384
00:15:02,832 --> 00:15:05,107
等一下
Huh? Oh. L-let me see.

385
00:15:05,107 --> 00:15:08,064
谢谢你们来参加
Thank you for joining us on our sp-

386
00:15:08,680 --> 00:15:10,040
不 不 先要有雷鸣闪电
No, no, no. First the thunder and the lightning!

387
00:15:10,160 --> 00:15:11,200
好的 就来
Yeah, right. I got it.

388
00:15:12,420 --> 00:15:13,060
要命了
Perfect.

389
00:15:13,200 --> 00:15:15,560
谢谢你们
Thank you for joining us...

390
00:15:15,560 --> 00:15:17,620
参与我们的特别之夜
on our special night.

391
00:15:18,120 --> 00:15:21,140
其他小孩的下场可不怎么样
Other children haven't fared so well.

392
00:15:21,505 --> 00:15:25,454
欢迎来到你们的噩梦
Welcome to your nightmare. Ha ha ha ha!

393
00:15:25,454 --> 00:15:26,787
那是怎么回事
What the hell is that?

394
00:15:26,787 --> 00:15:28,561
能不能 直接把糖给我们
Can, uh -- can we just get our candy?

395
00:15:28,561 --> 00:15:31,528
好的 但是小心有雾
OK, but beware of the fog,

396
00:15:31,528 --> 00:15:33,012
因为你们可能看不清前
for you may not be able to see...

397
00:15:33,420 --> 00:15:34,160
头
"ahead."

398
00:15:35,207 --> 00:15:37,412
然后迪米就开始跑
Boop. Timmy started running.

399
00:15:37,480 --> 00:15:38,480
我也想跑的
I wanted to run too,

400
00:15:38,480 --> 00:15:39,980
可是我的肥肉被玫瑰花丛缠住了
but my hunch got stuck on a rose bush

401
00:15:39,980 --> 00:15:41,040
所以我就摔倒了
and that's when I fell.

402
00:15:41,380 --> 00:15:42,260
狠狠地摔了一跤
I fell hard.

403
00:15:42,340 --> 00:15:43,780
我看得到他的脚
I can see his feet.

404
00:15:43,907 --> 00:15:47,375
好吧 给 孩子们 拿点糖
Okay. Here, children, have some candy.

405
00:15:47,800 --> 00:15:49,200
万圣节快乐
Happy Halloween.

406
00:15:52,427 --> 00:15:54,471
好吧 刚才真烂 开局不利
Ok. That was bad. That was a bad start.

407
00:15:54,471 --> 00:15:58,310
首先 爸 雷鸣闪电 然后放雾
Er... First of all, dad, thunder, lightening, fog cue.

408
00:15:58,310 --> 00:16:00,405
然后我们一起转向艾丽克斯
And we skip Alex all together.

409
00:16:00,405 --> 00:16:03,232
歌洛莉亚 你什么时候开始说英语了
And...Gloria, since when do you speak English?

410
00:16:03,360 --> 00:16:07,140
你现在也开始不爽我的口音了
Oh, so now you have a problem with the way I speak?

411
00:16:07,140 --> 00:16:11,420
有其父必有其女 真是个狗咬狗的家庭
Like father like daughter. In this dog-eat-dog family.

412
00:16:11,620 --> 00:16:12,740
不给糖就捣乱
Trick or treat?

413
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:14,240
好了 各就各位 各就各位
Okay. Places, places.

414
00:16:14,909 --> 00:16:16,282
很好 米奇尔也不见了
Good, Mitchell's gone.

415
00:16:16,340 --> 00:16:17,340
亲爱的 我好爱你
Honey, I love you so much!

416
00:16:17,340 --> 00:16:18,420
不是时候 不是时候
Not now, not now.

417
00:16:19,480 --> 00:16:22,560
有种的话就进来吧
Come in...if you dare.

418
00:16:23,048 --> 00:16:26,817
-爸 爸 -什么 对了 对了
- Dad. Dad. - What? Oh, right, right.

419
00:16:28,240 --> 00:16:30,585
-菲尔到你了 -不对 爸 雾
- Phil, it's you. - No, dad, fog, fog.

420
00:16:30,585 --> 00:16:32,440
感谢你们来参加
Thank you for joining us...

421
00:16:32,440 --> 00:16:34,645
我们的特别之夜
on our special night.

422
00:16:34,645 --> 00:16:38,564
其他小孩的下场可不怎么样
Other children haven't fared so well.

423
00:16:38,620 --> 00:16:41,480
救救我 救救我
Oh, help me, help me.

424
00:16:41,751 --> 00:16:45,049
欢迎来到你们的噩梦
Welcome to your nightmare. Ha ha ha ha.

425
00:16:45,260 --> 00:16:47,760
你们的糖在这里
Now your treats are over here

426
00:16:47,960 --> 00:16:49,480
但是雾这么大
but with all the fog

427
00:16:49,480 --> 00:16:52,120
你们可能看不清前
you may not be able to see

428
00:16:52,120 --> 00:16:53,060
头
"ahead".

429
00:16:53,180 --> 00:16:54,440
然后大家都在喊
And everyone was screaming

430
00:16:54,671 --> 00:16:56,505
就是他 抓住敲钟人
"That's him! Get Quasimodo!"

431
00:16:56,516 --> 00:16:58,460
于是镇里人就开始追我
And then the townspeople started chasing me!

432
00:16:58,460 --> 00:17:00,020
然后我就尿裤子了
And that's when I wet my pants!

433
00:17:00,280 --> 00:17:03,260
我尿裤子了 我尿裤子了
I wet my pants! I wet my pants.

434
00:17:03,880 --> 00:17:06,900
这地方好诡异 我们走
This place is weird. Let's go.

435
00:17:08,160 --> 00:17:09,680
圣母玛利亚
Mother of god.

436
00:17:09,756 --> 00:17:12,463
混账东西
Ohh! Son of a...

437
00:17:12,573 --> 00:17:14,437
你们到底是怎么回事
What is wrong with everyone?!

438
00:17:14,800 --> 00:17:16,000
小卡 "镇里人" 你在说什么
Cam, "townspeople"? Really?

439
00:17:16,040 --> 00:17:17,560
我住在农场 他们住在镇里
I lived on a farm. They lived in town.

440
00:17:17,580 --> 00:17:18,880
他们就是镇里人
They were the townspeople.

441
00:17:19,369 --> 00:17:20,541
还有爸 爸
And, dad! Dad!

442
00:17:20,541 --> 00:17:23,638
应该是 闪电 雷鸣 放雾
It goes -- lightning, thunder, fog cue!

443
00:17:23,638 --> 00:17:26,585
这整件事就够雾蒙蒙的了
This whole thing is a colossal fog cue.

444
00:17:26,660 --> 00:17:28,780
克莱尔不会明白的 小卡
Claire just doesn't understand, Cam.

445
00:17:28,860 --> 00:17:32,280
也许她从来没有因与众不同而被欺负
Maybe she's never been picked on for being different.

446
00:17:32,280 --> 00:17:34,240
你有吗 歌洛莉亚
When, Gloria?

447
00:17:34,600 --> 00:17:36,480
你什么时候因为
When have you ever been picked on

448
00:17:36,480 --> 00:17:38,140
"与众不同"而被欺负过
for "being different"?

449
00:17:38,680 --> 00:17:40,060
问问"夜龙"就知道了
Ask the "Gargle."

450
00:17:40,979 --> 00:17:43,675
她在说什么
What did she say?

451
00:17:44,096 --> 00:17:45,199
歌洛莉亚
Gloria!

452
00:17:45,900 --> 00:17:47,454
我觉得她疯了
I think she went insane.

453
00:17:47,454 --> 00:17:49,839
她没疯 她是我妈
She's not insane. She's my mother.

454
00:17:49,839 --> 00:17:52,155
我现在才是你妈
I'm your mother now!

455
00:17:52,520 --> 00:17:53,160
歌洛莉亚
Gloria...

456
00:17:53,500 --> 00:17:54,960
我想给你讲个故事
I want to tell you a story...

457
00:17:55,840 --> 00:17:57,520
一个男人独自在餐厅吃饭
about a guy eating in a diner, alone.

458
00:17:58,048 --> 00:18:00,484
他听到身后有一个女人在讲话
Behind him he hears a woman talking.

459
00:18:00,484 --> 00:18:02,759
他一直没有转过身来 五分钟过了 十分钟过了
He doesn't turn around, 5 minutes, 10 minutes.

460
00:18:02,759 --> 00:18:05,004
他只是静静地聆听着那位女士
Just listening to the woman,

461
00:18:05,004 --> 00:18:06,197
听她声音中的生命力
the life in her voice.

462
00:18:06,300 --> 00:18:07,640
他还未与她谋面
And before he even sees her

463
00:18:07,640 --> 00:18:09,240
就爱她爱得无法自拔
He realizes he's fallen in love.

464
00:18:09,920 --> 00:18:12,020
现在 我想让你猜猜那个男人是谁
Now, I'll give you a guess who that guy is.

465
00:18:16,281 --> 00:18:17,524
我爸好
Aw, my dad was --

466
00:18:18,300 --> 00:18:19,280
我的天啊
Oh, my god!

467
00:18:19,380 --> 00:18:20,740
你知道吗 我打算现在就走了
You know what? I'm just gonna go.

468
00:18:20,960 --> 00:18:22,140
别啊 小卡 别这样
No. Come on, Cam.

469
00:18:22,706 --> 00:18:24,560
要是小卡舅夫要走
Uh, if uncle Cam is leaving,

470
00:18:24,560 --> 00:18:25,983
那我也要回楼上读书去了
I'm just gonna go upstairs and study.

471
00:18:25,983 --> 00:18:27,817
我还要去赶个派对 所以
Yeah, I have a party to go to, so...

472
00:18:27,827 --> 00:18:30,033
她往我脸上挥了一拳
Ohh! She punched me in the face!

473
00:18:30,420 --> 00:18:31,840
他不知从哪里突然冒出来
He came out of nowhere, and he scared

474
00:18:31,840 --> 00:18:33,160
把老娘吓的魂都没了
the baby "cheeses" out of me!

475
00:18:33,220 --> 00:18:34,840
你开始像平常一样的说话了
Hey, you're talking normal again.

476
00:18:35,736 --> 00:18:38,212
我好爱那个老男人的故事
Oh, I loved the story about the old man.

477
00:18:38,212 --> 00:18:39,545
我可没说"老"这个字
Well, nobody said "old".

478
00:18:39,545 --> 00:18:41,419
-小卡 我们可以走了吗 -可以
- Oh, Cam, can we please just go? - Yes.

479
00:18:41,419 --> 00:18:42,993
好 求你们了 都走吧 我才不在乎呢
Yeah, go, please. I don't care.

480
00:18:42,993 --> 00:18:43,805
克莱尔
Oh, Claire.

481
00:18:43,815 --> 00:18:45,478
没事 没事
No, no.

482
00:18:45,478 --> 00:18:47,874
都完了 到此为止吧
I'm done. I'm done.

483
00:18:49,220 --> 00:18:52,220
还没 我压根就还没说完呢 你们自己想想
I'm not done. So not done. Look, here's the thing.

484
00:18:52,725 --> 00:18:55,241
我们 我们现在圣诞节放烟火
We - we have reworks at Christmas now

485
00:18:55,241 --> 00:18:57,887
因为那是哥伦比亚人的过节方式 我能接受
because that's what they do in Colombia, and I don't mind.

486
00:18:57,887 --> 00:18:59,862
感恩节 以前都是由我来给大家烤火鸡
Thanksgiving - that used to be me roasting a turkey,

487
00:18:59,862 --> 00:19:01,115
直到同性恋夫夫把这活拿走了
until the gays took it over

488
00:19:01,115 --> 00:19:03,210
然后用按他们在美食频道看的最新潮的
with whatever new turkey-cooking craze it is

489
00:19:03,210 --> 00:19:04,563
火鸡料理方法来料理
that you saw on the Food Network.

490
00:19:04,563 --> 00:19:05,565
我也一样没意见
And, I'm fine with that too.

491
00:19:05,705 --> 00:19:09,685
我只求 我只求你们能把万圣节留给我
All I ask - all I ask is that you leave me Halloween.

492
00:19:09,685 --> 00:19:10,787
没错 万圣节
Yeah, Halloween.

493
00:19:10,787 --> 00:19:13,022
我知道这是个疯狂的节日
I realize it is a crazy-ass holiday

494
00:19:13,022 --> 00:19:14,616
疯狂到可以让一个中年熟女如此在乎
for a grown woman to care about this much.

495
00:19:14,616 --> 00:19:17,373
但那就是属于我的疯狂节日
But it is my crazy-ass holiday.

496
00:19:17,400 --> 00:19:17,860
我的
Mine.

497
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:27,860
她还真是一肚子怨气啊
That's a lot of complaining from somebody

498
00:19:27,860 --> 00:19:30,860
去年我们做的火鸡 她要了三次呢
who asked for thirds of our tandoori turkey last year.

499
00:19:33,040 --> 00:19:33,640
克莱尔
Claire.

500
00:19:34,020 --> 00:19:36,040
不想 不想 我现在不想说话
No! No! Not ready to talk!

501
00:19:36,580 --> 00:19:36,880
不想
No.

502
00:19:40,320 --> 00:19:40,920
你听我说
Listen...

503
00:19:40,920 --> 00:19:42,860
我知道我今天没怎么帮到忙
I know I haven't been much help today.

504
00:19:43,473 --> 00:19:45,327
但那 那杰瑞跟朱蒂的事情
That - that whole Jerry and Judy thing,

505
00:19:45,327 --> 00:19:46,791
真的让我心不在焉
it really hit me hard.

506
00:19:47,432 --> 00:19:49,317
你一整天疯疯癫癫的就是为这破事吗
Is that why you've been acting like such a nut all day?

507
00:19:49,317 --> 00:19:52,294
-万一有天那发生在我们身上怎么办 -宝贝
- You know, what if someday that's us? - Honey!

508
00:19:52,294 --> 00:19:54,639
好吧 你 你现在可能不会想听到这个
Okay, you - you might not want to hear this right now

509
00:19:54,639 --> 00:19:58,277
因为我刚刚在里面大发了脾气 但是
after the meltdown I just had in there, but...

510
00:19:58,488 --> 00:20:00,783
你休想逃出我的手掌心
you're kind of stuck with me.

511
00:20:00,793 --> 00:20:02,728
你保证吗
You promise?

512
00:20:04,560 --> 00:20:05,360
我愿意
I do.

513
00:20:09,022 --> 00:20:11,187
真好
Oh. That's great.

514
00:20:11,187 --> 00:20:13,232
不给糖 就捣蛋
Trick or treat?

515
00:20:13,763 --> 00:20:15,207
我们应该就放一大碗的糖果
We should just put out a bowl of candy

516
00:20:15,207 --> 00:20:16,359
然后一起喝杯鸡尾酒 对吧
and have a cocktail, right?

517
00:20:16,359 --> 00:20:17,813
-对的 -好吧
-Yeah. -Yeah.

518
00:20:17,813 --> 00:20:19,908
有种的话就进来吧
Come in if you dare.

519
00:20:19,908 --> 00:20:22,514
谢谢你们来参加我们的特别之夜
thank you for joining us on our special night.

520
00:20:22,514 --> 00:20:24,849
其他小孩的下场可不怎么样
Other children haven't fared so well.

521
00:20:24,849 --> 00:20:26,724
-救救我 救救我 -她们真的在演
-Help me! Help me! -She's doing it.

522
00:20:26,724 --> 00:20:30,983
-欢迎来到你们的恶梦 孩子们 -不要 不要
- Welcome to your nightmare, muchachos! - No!no!

523
00:20:32,387 --> 00:20:35,714
但是雾这么大 你们可能看不清前 头
But with all this fog, it might be hard to see "ahead."

524
00:20:38,210 --> 00:20:40,395
-棒啊 -好啊
-Yeah! -Yeah!

525
00:20:45,420 --> 00:20:47,740
我们回来参与了 走吧
We're back in the game! Let's go!

526
00:20:47,853 --> 00:20:49,035
我爱死了 我爱死这个了
I love it! I love it!

527
00:20:49,035 --> 00:20:50,469
特别为你弄的
Whoa! That was for you.

528
00:20:50,469 --> 00:20:53,776
-特别为你触发的 我为了你弄的 -你才不是呢
-That was for you. I just did it for you. -No, it wasn't.

529
00:20:55,040 --> 00:20:57,380
有一次她说 别开玩笑
Oh, and one time she says don't joke

530
00:20:57,380 --> 00:20:59,240
别逼老娘对你不仁不"腻"
or I'll have to give you the "Hindenburg maneuver".

531
00:20:59,860 --> 00:21:01,234
有一次 她发现我在放空
Oh, one time she caught me staring off.

532
00:21:01,234 --> 00:21:02,637
她就说 小卡 怎么了
And she goes, "Cam, what's wrong?

533
00:21:02,637 --> 00:21:04,912
你看起来像有头虱的鹿[鹿灯综合症]
You look like a deer in head lice!".

534
00:21:05,700 --> 00:21:08,620
当兵那会 我有个工作 基本上就是
In the service, I had a job, briefly,

535
00:21:09,340 --> 00:21:10,380
处理炸药
handling explosives.

536
00:21:10,455 --> 00:21:12,750
听起来很危险 其实不然
Which sounds dangerous, but it's not.

537
00:21:13,700 --> 00:21:15,160
你把它们存放在适宜的温度之下
You store them at the right temperature,

538
00:21:15,180 --> 00:21:16,160
就不会有任何危险
you have no problems...

539
00:21:16,620 --> 00:21:17,920
要是你告诉她 她别无选择
If you tell her she doesn't have a choice,

540
00:21:18,000 --> 00:21:20,260
她会说 别给我个老番茄[最后通牒ultimatum]
She'll say, "don't you give me an 'old tomato.'"

541
00:21:21,260 --> 00:21:23,435
-或者当她说 -好了 够了
- Or when she says - Okay! Enough!

542
00:21:23,720 --> 00:21:25,320
你们试试说外语
You try speaking in another language!

543
00:21:25,480 --> 00:21:26,980
所有人滚出我家
Everybody out of my house!

544
00:21:27,660 --> 00:21:28,780
直到忽然爆发
...until you do.
